{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam01_title", "source_sha256": "d2664601920a3df35f1a3e58babd971a8af578615c3dd95cd875d1741adb7e59", "ja": "環とおでかけ1", "zh": "与环外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ccc91ae8e944c536190eb8027c74cee0bb7e825d76fdd97a088b231ef03e1d8e", "ja": "環とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "和环一起外出的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c53a9f344d24018aa22535d78ee20a47b2e2f3bf70290570e7400ac4eb1edd67", "ja": "（環が雪合戦大会にゲスト選手として出場する\nことになった。ここは是非とも勝ちたいな！）", "zh": "（环要作为特邀选手参加打雪仗大会。一定要在这里赢下来才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam01_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "1276d91c84d518146016b1797108df8d0fa956f4eb7280430bad5b4c53431399", "ja": "おやぶん、おやぶん！　雪合戦たのしそうだぞー！\nたまき、ぜったい勝ちたい！", "zh": "老大，老大！打雪仗好像很有意思呀——！\n环环绝对想赢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "fd1d4d8785a1c111c488a854c890a58c4fa3bc76375033aa31755602fd243531", "ja": "その意気だ！　聞いたところによると、\n雪合戦は雪玉作りのスピードがコツらしい。", "zh": "就是这个劲头！听说，打雪仗的诀窍在于制作雪球的速度。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam01_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "8dfd7628725cc9aae4f5be29aec69af351236a71ef5abc9c03ac61591ca3f4ab", "ja": "へえー、そうなんだ！　じゃあたまき、\n超はやいスピードで、雪だまつくるぞ～！", "zh": "诶——原来是这样啊！那环，环就用超级快的速度来堆雪球～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam01_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "0391789344f8a4ea540875399209afb3483a20d15eae28d49ce3424d881a0bbf", "ja": "あっ、もうすぐ試合がはじまるみたい！\nおやぶん、見ててね！", "zh": "啊，比赛好像马上就要开始了！\n老大，看好了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "189945c2b7abcff9ca2f5c197cb60ed8d2f84b3cbeccd7846df0dff7b9186030", "ja": "（試合序盤、相手チームの攻撃に耐えつつ、\n環はものすごいスピードで雪玉を作り溜め……）", "zh": "（比赛刚开始，在抵挡对方队伍进攻的同时，环以惊人的速度制作并积攒着雪球……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam01_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "24b1e48bda21adb45339529189cb7a853410cb37a6220d9d3a3e8838b617f80d", "ja": "いまだっ！　とつげきするぞ！\nくらえっ、超はやい玉なげ！", "zh": "就是现在！冲上去！\n接招吧，超快雪球投掷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a3fba39aea546a5ae5d577a58073528f62e8d5342e7b8e5894a1819d14245fc7", "ja": "（素早く反撃に転じた環チームは、相手チームを封殺！\n素早い雪玉作りを活かした勝利だったな……！）", "zh": "（迅速转守为攻的环队彻底压制了对手队伍！这是充分发挥快速制作雪球这一优势取得的胜利啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam01_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "08a40bb70d8678a7bb7ce9dce3d91594cf8a0d4a8d3a5d8766ce727fa773e8de", "ja": "おやぶんの作戦のおかげで勝てたぞー！\n雪合戦、たのしいね！　くふふっ♪", "zh": "多亏了老大的作战，我们赢了哦——！\n打雪仗真开心！咕呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d8e2750f93c410bcfde98d82402a28d4e68b72f0910a9177a5bee15a1351a25e", "ja": "（その後、スタッフの方に温かい豚汁をいただいて\n身も心も温まった。清々しい、勝利の味だな……！）", "zh": "（之后，工作人员给了她热腾腾的猪肉味噌汤，身心都暖和起来了。这就是酣畅淋漓的胜利滋味啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
